        "description": "Identifies `kelados speak`, which synthesizes audio from inline text or a file (-f/--file) and writes a WAV file to the path given by -o/--output. Covers the installed bin and npx, bunx, npm exec, pnpm dlx and yarn dlx launches of the kelados package.",
